@guide A_Arathi
@name Arathi Highlands (Refuge Pointe)
@faction Alliance
@levels 30-34
@zone Arathi Highlands
@chapter Azeroth
@desc Refuge Pointe, Northfold Manor, Stromgarde and the Shards of Myzrael. Then south to Stranglethorn.
@next A_Stranglethorn

fp Refuge Pointe
accept Northfold Manor | Captain Nials, Refuge Pointe.
accept Wanted!  Marez Cowl [elite; group=3; optional]
accept Wanted!  Otto and Falconcrest [elite; group=3; optional]
accept The Princess Trapped | The Shards of Myzrael object, south-east of Refuge Pointe.
complete Northfold Manor | Syndicate at Northfold Manor, north-west.
turnin Northfold Manor
accept Stromgarde Badges
complete The Princess Trapped | Kill Kobolds at Drywhisker Gorge for Iridescent Shards.
turnin The Princess Trapped
accept Stones of Binding
complete Stones of Binding | Collect the three Cresting, Thundering and Burning keys at the stones.
turnin Stones of Binding
accept Breaking the Keystone
complete Stromgarde Badges | Syndicate inside Stromgarde Keep (west).
turnin Stromgarde Badges
complete Breaking the Keystone
turnin Breaking the Keystone
accept Myzrael's Allies [optional]
complete Wanted!  Marez Cowl [elite; group=3; optional]
complete Wanted!  Otto and Falconcrest [elite; group=3; optional]
turnin Wanted!  Marez Cowl [optional]
turnin Wanted!  Otto and Falconcrest [optional]
level 33
train
note Fly from Refuge Pointe to Ironforge or Stormwind, then on to Booty Bay or Rebel Camp (northern Stranglethorn).
